{"server":"tw","storyId":"act15mini_level_act15mini_st01","groupId":"act15mini","stageId":null,"title":"沉於冰寒","storyCode":"","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act15mini/level_act15mini_st01.txt","sourceHash":"fd335782c6a8628379e45510246ad8bf780460d6d4002140eff7194b23c482e6","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"烏薩斯，冰原入口，萊特-科欽斯基科考補給站"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"40_g2_glacier"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼——終於到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"裝置","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘀嘀，請說出口令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳嗯——哥倫比亞比倫哥，烏薩斯卡特斯多索雷斯，厚羅燒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"裝置","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"口令內容......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"裝置","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"確認。Xорошо，哥倫比亞人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"裝置","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"發聲人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"裝置","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"確認。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"裝置","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"萊茵生命，編號CRL005——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"裝置","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（奇特的語調）買買買賣唉艾~哲~倫~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"裝置","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"歡迎訪問萊特-科欽斯基科考補給站。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（掏出筆記本記錄）“烏薩斯境內W-K站語音系統輕微受損——”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“——暫無維修必要。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就這樣好了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmencommand"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瑪麗老師的隊伍大概帶走了一、二、三......二十人份的生存物資？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"十五人卻帶了二十人份的東西......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（掏出筆記本記錄）“物資僅剩百分之五，可供十人使用（已扣除本人將使用的份額），需要重新補給物資。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再讓我看看——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"結構......沒有損傷。能源......不用補充。維生設備......還好，溫度沒有問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"急救包沒有使用跡象，門窗也都沒有外部破壞的痕跡......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有最後一項......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（操作科考站設備）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是這條路線沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（確認沿途科考站回傳的訊號）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一路上都是例行彙報，看來沒遇上麻煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_g2_colombiaoffice"},{"type":"narration","text":"兩個月前"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"哥倫比亞特里蒙市，萊茵生命總部，科學考察科"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我就準備出發了，還有什麼要交代的事情嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科考科成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_530_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別的應該沒有了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科考科成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_530_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（輕聲）最後還有一件，但這個你千萬別告訴其他人啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？嗯嗯，我會保密的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科考科成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_530_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（四處張望）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科考科成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_530_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（輕聲）馬里亞姆主任的隊伍在冰原失蹤了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？！瑪麗老師怎——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚唔唔唔！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科考科成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_530_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（輕聲）小聲點啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，唔唔。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科考科成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_530_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（輕聲）總之就是這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科考科成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_530_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（輕聲）你這次去，搜救主任的隊伍是最優先事項。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科考科成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_530_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（輕聲）探索協會那邊已經在組織搜救隊了，但你也知道，那幫人效率一直不怎麼樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科考科成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_530_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（輕聲）主任他們......就只能先靠你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（輕聲）我知道了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmencommand"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（操作科考站設備）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其餘站點都沒異常。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也就是說他們還在一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或者......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哥倫比亞站傳來的訊號？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（操作科考站設備）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（拿起聽筒）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這裡！@#$比亞站......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們受#！@%&，需要*......#$！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"座標——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瑪麗老師自己發送的訊號，也就是說他本人還在那裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是訊號轉到這要花不少時間......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（拍了拍自己的臉頰）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是先做最要緊的事吧，麥哲倫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（按下操作台按鈕）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"裝置","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘀嘀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"CRL005，麥哲倫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"裝置","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"身份已確認，有什麼我可以幫助您的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"將近三個月的訊號收發記錄加密傳輸回哥倫比亞，謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"裝置","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"已確認，開始加密回傳至信使站點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（關閉操作台）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"探索協會設立的基站和烏薩斯通用，還蠻方便的，申請借道進入冰原的入境許可也容易多了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等烏薩斯的信使先生過來確認完文件就該出發了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瑪麗老師，您可別碰上什麼大麻煩，我馬上就來幫您。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還真快......請您稍等一下，我馬上來！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"薇恩塔·麥哲倫小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是伊萬先生嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是的，和往常一樣，例行公事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我這就給您開門。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"40_g2_glacier"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您好，伊萬先生，您要先進來休息下嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"您應該知道規矩，麥哲倫小姐，我只要再往前走半步，就足夠讓哥倫比亞人找我們麻煩了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您不說，我不說，不會有人知道的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"你們的小機器盯得可緊了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些系統還沒智慧到您想像的那個程度呢，哈哈~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"和哥倫比亞人打交道，小心點不會錯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，我相信您是個實在的人，不會給我們添麻煩。但謹慎起見，還是請您允許我拒絕您的邀請。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，請出示文件。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿咻。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"應該都在這裡了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......入境許可......探險許可......探險路線確認書......地圖繪製委託......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"很好，麥哲倫小姐，您的文件沒有問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，我有一個不幸的消息要告訴您——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"今年所有的冰原考察許可都被取消了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這，但是，文件應該都......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"您應該也不是第一次碰到這種事情了，請理解一下我們的苦衷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我有很急的事情一定要進冰原，您、您能不能通融一下？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"您不妨把急事說給我聽，或許我能幫您想個辦法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事情是這樣的，我們有支隊伍在冰原裡失蹤了，我得想辦法找到他們，至少確認他們的情況。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是攸關人命的大事，您要是有什麼條件，可以直接告訴我，只要能讓我先去救人，我什麼都能答應您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"這您應該透過官方管道反應，等待我國的救援隊行動，而不是這樣冒失地一個人出發。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白，我都明白，可官方救援隊行動總得要時間準備，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也是個探險家，對冰原的情況還算熟悉，能早一天找到他們，之後的救援都會更方便些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"我瞭解了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，您方便透露一下失蹤人員的座標嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？可、可以的，請稍等。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大概就在這個位置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"（烏薩斯方言）我拿到哥倫比亞人的座標了，從地點上看，北邊的事應該和他們有關係。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（烏薩斯方言）很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"（烏薩斯方言）這個小姑娘怎麼處理？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（烏薩斯方言）聽說她是哥倫比亞的資深探險家，我們需要確認她對於哥倫比亞的重要程度。盯著她，等待進一步指示。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"（烏薩斯方言）明白。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊萬先生......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"我和我的同僚們確認過了，抱歉，麥哲倫小姐，我們還是不能讓您從這裡去北邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"前方都被軍事管制了，即使是我也過不去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"但作為補償，我會與您同行。只要是在烏薩斯境內，您想去哪裡都可以，我以烏薩斯官方人員的身份，可以為您行個方便。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我想想......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，薩米！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走薩米進冰原的話，是不是就不會被封鎖了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"理論上來說，是的。但——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們就先去薩米！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經準備好了，麻煩您現在就帶我去，伊萬先生。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"（烏薩斯方言）她想從薩米進冰原，你們那邊調查的時間夠嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（烏薩斯方言）隨她的意就行，調查一個有公開身份的哥倫比亞人用不了多久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（烏薩斯方言）到了邊境，邊防軍會派人接手你的差事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"（烏薩斯方言）嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（烏薩斯方言）小心點，別被“女巫”盯上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"（烏薩斯方言）收到。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，如您所願，麥哲倫小姐。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"40_g2_glacier"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“士兵”","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"長官，請留步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“長官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"你有疑問，士兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“士兵”","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"是的長官，關於......我們的任務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“長官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"你對軍隊的安排有疑慮？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“士兵”","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不敢，長官。我只是覺得，對待薩米人——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“長官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"你憐憫那些動物？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“士兵”","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"是的長官，我認為——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“士兵”","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"您剛剛，說什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“長官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"我能理解你的同情心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“長官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我問你一個問題吧，士兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“長官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得，你是一位農場主的兒子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“士兵”","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，長官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“長官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，在你家的土地上，馱獸們繁衍，拉車，在你父親的意志下創造價值......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“長官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有你父親的馴養，牠們自己會有這種想法嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“士兵”","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"當然不會，長官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“長官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"那你憑什麼認為薩米人會？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“士兵”","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，長官——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“長官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"烏薩斯人推翻駿鷹統治之後，用了千年將自己的土地改造成烏薩斯所需要的模樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“長官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"而薩米，仍是一片荒林。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“長官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"對於文明，薩米人毫無益處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“士兵”","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“長官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"我相信一些薩米人經過適當的點撥能夠理解烏薩斯的苦心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“長官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"我們為他們帶去文明之火，他們應當感激涕零。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“長官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"而薩米人的反應，我想不需要我多說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“士兵”","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，長官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“長官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"他們聽不懂文明的勸導，只知道弱肉強食。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“長官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，暴力就是必要之惡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“長官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"當他們的後代住上堅固的房屋，享受烏薩斯帶來的文化與產物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“長官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"他們終究會理解的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“士兵”","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白了，長官。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“斥候”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"報告，前方發現薩米人，正與邪魔交戰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“長官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"列隊，讓術師隊伍準備好源石技藝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“斥候”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“士兵”","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"長官，您......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“長官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"就算是不聽勸的馱獸，你也不希望他們被飢餓的野獸生吞活剝吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“長官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"全體聽令，準備進攻邪魔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“士兵”","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"——是，長官！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一週後，薩烏邊境"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"再向前走一段路，就能到邊防軍邊境哨所，繼續往前走，就是薩米。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"我的護送到那裡為止。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這一路上多虧有您在，和烏薩斯人的交流順暢多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"您的烏薩斯語也說得不錯，如果沒有口音，那就更完美了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個啊，感覺一時半會兒也改不了，嘿嘿~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且我還有好多要學的，伊萬先生有時候說的話我一句都聽不懂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"那是我們小地方的方言，烏薩斯人都不一定能聽懂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"要是下次您來的時候日程不那麼緊迫，我可以教您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是嗎？謝謝謝謝！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，不用客氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"說起來，您對薩米熟悉嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還沒走過從薩米進冰原的路線呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽說穿過薩米本身需要的補給和進入冰原需要的補給是相等的，而且冰原上靠近薩米的科考站更少，補給不方便。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"您說得是，那是個野蠻的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊萬先生好像不太喜歡薩米。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"烏薩斯的邊境哨所一般都會有駐軍，然而薩米與烏薩斯邊境，只有邊防軍定期巡邏而沒有據點駐防。您知道是什麼原因嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"烏薩斯......是和薩米有什麼矛盾嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"矛盾？薩米人侵佔烏薩斯的領土，襲擊烏薩斯的士兵，只為了滿足他們原始邪惡的念頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"我們前面的哨所，曾經被薩米人無端霸佔，烏薩斯好心幫助他們擊退邪魔後才向他們提出抗議，希望能夠收回領土。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"可他們卻堅決不離開，還要傷害我們烏薩斯的軍人。我們最後別無他法，只能動用武力驅逐他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是這樣啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（是這樣......嗎？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"野蠻的薩米人為了復仇，派出了一個被我們叫作“女巫”的冤魂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"她殺死了這座哨所裡所有的烏薩斯士兵，而後一直在薩烏邊境上遊蕩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"遇見人數少的隊伍，她就用暴風雪圍困他們，並趁機殺害；遇見烏薩斯的重兵，她就躲在風雪中不出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"除不掉，又趕不走，很是煩人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"最終，我們只能採取精銳小隊巡查邊境的方式鞏固邊防，防止薩米人繼續造成破壞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"您路過薩米的時候，也一定要小心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"他們一見到外人，不撕裂喉嚨，不啜飲鮮血，是不會停手的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"就像對付雪原上集群的野獸，我們只能訴諸武力，讓他們不敢輕舉妄動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"您明白了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"外頭起風了，我們快進哨所休息吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"40_g2_glacier"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩米戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怪物還在嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩米薩滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它被驅逐了，我們應該安全了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩米戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......太好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩米戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，烏薩斯的朋友！你們那邊的情況如何？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏薩斯軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"我們這邊沒有出現傷亡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩米戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蕾雅，你那兒還有水嗎？給我們的烏薩斯朋友帶些過來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩米薩滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"馬上就來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩米戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，剛才真的好險，要不是你們幫上一把，我們這就得有幾個小雛羽去見先祖囉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏薩斯軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"請不要在意，那是我們共同的敵人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩米戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們一會準備去哪兒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏薩斯軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"我們正在執行軍務，只是恰好路過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩米戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們烏薩斯人真是古板，剛剛和邪魔打過一架，還想著什麼軍務軍務的，你的弟兄們也累得夠嗆吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩米戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到我們的營地裡來，休息一下，烤烤火吃點肉乾再上路也不遲，朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏薩斯軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們就......恭敬不如從命了，朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩米戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈，有什麼好客氣的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩米戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蕾雅，水呢？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩米薩滿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我還在給傷患包紮呢，你等一會！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩米戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用拿水了，讓我們的朋友直接去營地喝個夠！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩米戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"寒檀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩米戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你再確認一下有沒有其他的邪魔，我就先帶傷員和烏薩斯朋友們回去了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明白了，我處理好就回來。記得在樹下給我留個位置！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩米戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"少不了你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩米戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"起來吧小子們，回家嘍！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏薩斯軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"烏薩斯士兵聽令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏薩斯軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"列隊，前進。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡，真的是哨所嗎？裡面好寬闊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有中間那棵樹，伊萬先生，烏薩斯人有在建築中間種樹的習俗嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"那是薩米人種的，已經枯死很久了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"好在這棵樹的樹幹足夠結實，在雪原中也是難得的屏障，與其砍了做木柴，不如就讓它那樣豎著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"方圓百里明明沒有一棵樹，他們是怎麼把這一棵栽種到雪原中來的啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"這我並不清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以......採些樣本嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"請便。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"（烏薩斯方言）我們到枯樹哨所了，女巫沒來找我們麻煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（烏薩斯方言）我們也查明了，這個女孩沒什麼背景，而且在冰原上還有一些可利用的價值。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（烏薩斯方言）邊防軍會儘快向你的位置靠近，接收到這個女孩後會直接轉交給調查隊，他們需要一個熟悉冰原情況的嚮導。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（烏薩斯方言）後續的事情不再需要你處理了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"（烏薩斯方言）收到，我先去準備信標，隨時聯繫。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"（烏薩斯方言）抱歉了，小傢伙。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"40_g2_glacier"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏薩斯軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉了，“朋友”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩米戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們在做什麼，把武器放下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏薩斯軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"我的職責，便是為皇帝陛下開疆拓土。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩米戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏薩斯軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"從今往後，這裡就是烏薩斯的領土。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩米戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是，你、你究竟什麼意思？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏薩斯軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"我說得不夠明白嗎，野蠻人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏薩斯軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡是方圓百里唯一的聚居點，佔領了這裡，偉大的烏薩斯自然就成為了此地的主宰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏薩斯軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"這是烏薩斯的領土，請你們離開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩米戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們在這片土地上生活了那麼久，你就在這插了個旗子，憑什麼說這裡屬於你們！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏薩斯軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"因為我們來了，僅此而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏薩斯軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"哼......念在我們共同對抗過邪魔的情分上，我給你們兩個選擇，離開這裡，或是成為烏薩斯的子民。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏薩斯軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"你和你的族人都是優秀的戰士，烏薩斯很樂意接納你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏薩斯軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，你們要講烏薩斯語，穿烏薩斯的服飾，最重要的是，停止你們那駭人聽聞的異端信仰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩米戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩米薩滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（默唸咒語）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏薩斯軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"術師，讓那個女巫閉嘴。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩米薩滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃嗚......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩米戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蕾雅！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏薩斯軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"不要做傻事，也不要想著抵抗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩米戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩米戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）老樹啊，請為我見證......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩米戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！！！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏薩斯軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"你讓我沒得選擇，“朋友”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏薩斯軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"全體聽令，進攻。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"40_g2_glacier"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"（烏薩斯方言）請說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（烏薩斯方言）邊防軍那邊風向不太對，暴風雪可能要來了，你先去空地上布置信標引導他們前進，接觸後直接帶目標一起離開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"（烏薩斯方言）收到。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"您採完了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這棵樹的性狀太神奇了。從生物學上來說它確實已經完全枯萎，但我總覺得它好像還有一部分活得好好的，真奇怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是研究透了說不定能發表一篇大文章。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"那想必是學界的一大幸事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"暴風雪快來了，您還是先去哨所內避一避吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，好的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊萬先生不進去嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"我先去看一下暴風雪的規模，這樣萬一風雪大得超出預期，還有機會向附近的人求援。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請先喝口這個吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我剛剛熱了些水，您先喝一杯暖和下身子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"不用了，我很快就回來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊萬先生......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"37_g11_wsafehouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊萬先生在外頭工作，我一個人躲在建築裡烤火，這樣是不是不太合適......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼說我也是個探險家，遇到困難怎麼能讓同伴一個人去面對呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還是——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好冷......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（望向窗外）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚嗚，臉好痛......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"風速越來越快了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊萬先生，您要小心啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊萬先生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不對，那是？！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"40_i01"},{"type":"narration","text":"風暴掀起雪浪，朝著哨所的方向湧來。\n然而，它們像是聽到號令般控制著速度，緩緩向前推進。\n這並非因距離產生的視覺誤差，而是風雪本身正在聽從旨意。\n在得到允諾前，它們不敢讓雪花逾越施令者。\n而她，此時正在風雪前方，高舉權杖，緩緩向著哨所走來。\n一步，又一步。\n平穩，堅定，不容置疑。\n直到風雪淹沒大地——\n事情或許是這樣發生的，但在冰原邊境，麥哲倫比任何人都希望看到這一幕。\n因為那位行走在冰雪之間的女性，可是她在冰原上最好的朋友。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"37_g11_wsafehouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"西蒙娜姐！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"當這句話傳到遠方時，麥哲倫明顯感覺到，風雪似乎沒有那麼強勁了。\n而當西蒙娜走到麥哲倫面前，她身後的雪浪也在不知不覺間消失得無影無蹤。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好，麥哲倫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得你應該去冰原探險了，怎麼會想到要來這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"烏薩斯又把進冰原的路給封啦，但我敬重的老師在探索冰原時失蹤了，我無論如何都得去，所以只好繞個遠路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我熱了些茶水你要喝嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就謝謝你啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咕嘟......咕嘟......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，你是要從薩米進冰原。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我記得西蒙娜姐是薩米人吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都已經遇上了，哪還有不幫你的道理呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸嘿嘿~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那等伊萬先生回來，我和他告個別，我們就可以進薩米了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然我聽說，薩米有些原始，還很可怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個......那位烏薩斯信使是這麼和你說的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他還說這裡會有女巫出沒，會不由分說地襲擊別人，要我小心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"烏薩斯人就是這樣的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你覺得，那個女巫是個什麼樣的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我覺得她......有點可憐，就像這棵樹一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉。伊萬先生好像很厭惡薩米。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然他的用詞聽上去很中肯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們薩米人也一樣厭惡烏薩斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼呢？有誤會的話，大家不能好好聊一聊解開它嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為在他們眼裡，征服遠比理解有效率得多。他們眼裡只有一個擾人的女巫，可是無數薩米人已經被——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——時候不早了，你說你的信使朋友往哪裡去了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"北方，暴風雪來的位置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在這裡等著，我去幫他一把。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還是一起去比較——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麥哲倫，待在這。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在這裡更安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好、好吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"路上小心，西蒙娜姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小心，呃，小心女巫哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，她要是出現的話，我會離她遠遠的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一會再幫我熱杯茶好嗎，麥哲倫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯嗯！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又只剩下我一個人了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊萬先生和西蒙娜姐要是遇上了，真的能好好相處嗎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您覺得呢，大樹先生？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"亙古的枯樹以沉默作為它的答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還是不太能夠理解，為什麼能夠一起對抗敵人，卻非得因為其他事兵戎相見呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"合作......不全是正確的嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"悠久的枯樹思考了一陣，決定以枯枝間的碰撞作答。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那您呢，大樹先生？您也是因為不能被別人理解，所以才獨自來到這雪原上的嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"挺立的枯樹覺得這個問題不太好回答，於是它選擇保持沉默。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您說得對......這是個蠢問題......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，可以的話，我還是希望......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我回來了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"西蒙娜姐？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"給，這是你的熱茶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊萬先生呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在你說的位置找了一圈，沒能找到你提到的信使。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"北方的風雪近在咫尺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許，他已經呼叫援救，和烏薩斯邊防軍會合，就地避難了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"烏薩斯的哨所不夠堅固，這個規模的暴風雪，會把整棟建築壓潰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們或許也要......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能......再等一會嗎，伊萬先生是個很有經驗的信使，我們也認識很久了，這樣的暴風雪是不會困住他的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你堅持的話，那我們就再等一會好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我去和老樹報個平安。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老樹......西蒙娜姐，你是......這一帶的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我曾經的職責，就是護衛恆常的老樹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它跨越了死亡，但沒能被銘記。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而這一切，只是因為我們一時的熱心腸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"付出善意，收穫惡意，這片大地就是如此行事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，女巫......才會在這裡遊蕩......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許是吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"時間差不多了，我們再不走，就要被困在這裡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"找個背風的地方，給伊萬先生留個記號。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至少得讓他知道我安全離開了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......這樣應該就行了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要離開了，伊萬先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，麥哲倫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"40_g2_glacier"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和西蒙娜姐一起走，風雪都會變得很溫馴呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是略懂一些法術而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......你肩膀上的這個通訊器......總覺得在哪裡見過......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個？這個是我從烏薩斯人那裡買來的，效果不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你需要嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就算啦，哥倫比亞的通訊器比烏薩斯的好用多了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......西蒙娜姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有件事......我想和你道個歉......希望你不要生氣......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說來聽聽。"},{"type":"narration","text":"呃......之前，在哨所裡的時候，我一時興奮，在大樹先生身上採了樣本。\n你傷害了老樹？\n沒、沒有，是這樣的，我本來的確是想打孔採樣的，但在我碰到它的時候，大樹先生直接掉了兩塊樹皮下來。\n所以我，我真的沒有——\n樹皮？\n是的，請不要生氣，我沒有在樹上亂刻亂畫。\n能讓我......看一下樹皮嗎？\n欸？好，好的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"（嘗試將兩塊樹皮拼接在一起）\n（姬緹婭......）\n（海麗兒？）\n（......）\n（謝謝，謝謝您。）\n西蒙娜姐，怎麼了？\n沒事......\n這兩塊樹皮，你就留下吧，老樹不會責怪你的。\n噢。\n謝謝老樹。\n是啊，讚美老樹。\n風雪快來了，我們得加緊找個合適的地方過夜。\n走吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
